  "description": "Agent evaluation (n8n Evaluations, dataset = Data Table eval_scenarios from evals/scenarios.json). Each scenario is a scripted client of the eval tenant talking to the real pipeline turn by turn; checks: tools, escalation, outcome, prices, language, content. POST /webhook/admin/eval-report writes reports/eval-<date>.md from the results."
